Hanford Hotel & Resort Malta,Malta's Peninsula Hideaway,"De Paule Avenue, San Anton, BZN9023 Malta",Malta,Europe,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Hotel & Resort Malta</h1> <h4><em><strong>Malta&rsquo;s peninsula hideaway</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Located on a private seaside peninsula fringed by the Mediterranean Sea, Hanford Hotel &amp; Resort Malta has a villa-style lobby that is naturally lit thanks to floor-to-ceiling windows and 408 spacious rooms and suites.</p> <p>The property includes 66 Luxury Bay suites in their own annex right on the water&rsquo;s edge, featuring fully equipped kitchenettes, walk-in rain showers, free-standing bathtubs, mood lighting, and private terraces.&nbsp;</p> <p>Two expansive Presidential Penthouse Suites feature private pool decks, sweeping ocean views, and sun-drenched outdoor space for an unforgettable stay.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The resort's two lido decks provide direct access to the glittering blue water of the Mediterranean Sea, steps away from the main pool deck.</li> <li>Visit the hotel's dive center to explore the Maltese Islands’ world-renowned scuba diving sites with year-round PADI certification courses.</li> <li>Try your luck at the hotel’s casino, housed in a glorious 19th-century palace setting overlooking the coast.</li> <li>The two Presidential Penthouse Suites share the top floor, each offering private pool decks, four bedrooms, and vast outdoor terraces.</li> <li>The fully equipped gym features an indoor pool, high-tech training equipment, and dedicated studios to work up a sweat.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Located on a private 74,000-square-meter peninsula, the property is just minutes from major local sights and coastal attractions.</li> <li>The resort features two private beach lidos, outdoor pools, and dedicated shallow swimming zones for children.</li> <li>Dedicated 24-hour concierge services are available to assist guests with private island tours, boat charters, and dining bookings.</li> <li>The hotel provides comprehensive business facilities, elegant meeting rooms, and high-tech corporate event spaces.</li> <li>A wellness beauty clinic offers facial treatments, aromatherapy sessions, and relaxing therapeutic body wraps.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The 408 guest rooms and suites feature airy layouts, high-tech amenities, and sweeping views of the sea or lush gardens.</li> <li>Luxury Bay Suites located at the water's edge come with fully equipped kitchenettes, freestanding bathtubs, and rain showers.</li> <li>Presidential Penthouse Suites span four bedrooms, private pool decks, and wrap-around balconies with panoramic views.</li> <li>In-room amenities include private balconies or terraces, satellite TV, digital climate control, minibars, and plush bathrobes.</li> <li>Tower Rooms located at the end of each wing float right above the Mediterranean waters for an exceptional oceanfront feel.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The highly regarded main restaurant turns out simple dishes featuring the best local ingredients and fresh regional produce.</li> <li>The Terrace offers a wide selection of buffet offerings and live cooking stations served in a comfortable, elegant space.</li> <li>Palio's Trattoria delivers the ideal recipe for alfresco dining, combining Mediterranean views with aromatic Italian culinary flavors.</li> <li>The Boathouse Lounge, set in an original 19th-century boathouse right on the ocean, is known for fine wines, champagne, and tapas.</li> <li>The lobby lounge and adjoining outdoor space offer light bites and handcrafted cocktails accompanied by live piano music.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Bar, Beach, Fitness classes, Golf, Gym, House car service, Indoor pool, Kids Club, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Pet friendly, Restaurants, Spa, Arabella Spa, Three-tiered Cascade Pool, Egyptian brine bath, Hydropool, Ice cave, Jet showers, Sea-facing terraces, Explorer’s Club",349,499,"2,499","2,999",169,"2,799",79,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1kNWzw6IkHrDK91iDoaIXsrqgF3VX22G0/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1m2IuMW2LjlOnh0a9bj-xgvlgkW4TIRKr/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/13a_612I_QJOUWCE2QVY8_mGJTVHSPYIY/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1kNWzw6IkHrDK91iDoaIXsrqgF3VX22G0/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZqtxlVt_kDT0COa8-1Un0tWhsTExnDvL/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rMpktczNyr2DMZpNJ4o177KRWU7vFymB/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/15_7-_iZ0BDPU-8cdNnGlTN_-B8oLMhx8/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZOgWf0E9_vagircaolhojHz0l-_X29WB/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Cn2FUAFAA57bN_d7rBAXLoGo4K0GtI8O/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/16GzPYhzX3yfMRPg0xSQbio1Vtj7ttNfe/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ozko0KZZ8fRZfYVoA-OaPcL5JCllV8rv/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_5vPAX4fc8U3HUwxYd51J75urX2g-HS8/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EuqbOMNKHAwWXX88gyRa2D53yrx5bdTk/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cy-lcTNLrezKFUoIINhEPbtRLiWrdy4R/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NhEWbCEhdnaGTeM_RvIQt6H12rU2rz-r/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1piKQ-mOMidphKuFnVsTKbgTiFiOgnta-/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OIsV3eRQLzITgncyngWtD1JUFyn5UAlC/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sjQIl1iKNLt3MSNsvT_j8luGC4uzgL3Z/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1D4ebOLsKFJsVrJbJ_99WhtwTQUCRcqVY/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.co