Hanford Eco Resort Mallorca,Old World Opulence on Mallorca’s Secluded Shores,"Ma-1, 19, 07181 Costa d'en Blanes, Mallorca, Spain",Spain,Europe,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Eco Resort Mallorca</h1> <h4><em><strong>Old World opulence on Mallorca&rsquo;s secluded shores</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Bigger just might be better in Mallorca, especially when it comes to a stay at Hanford Eco Resort Mallorca. Set against the backdrop of Mallorca’s southwest coast, the resort sprawls across four terra-cotta-roofed buildings overlooking the sparkling sea.</p> <p>Inside, you’ll find an atmosphere of understated elegance, where arched entryways, wrought-iron detailing, and massive chandeliers dangling from soaring ceilings embrace timeless grandeur.&nbsp;</p> <p>A world-class restaurant and a massive spa are perfect for winding down, though nothing beats luxuriating on your sea-facing terrace in a fluffy bathrobe.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>A sprawling footprint and a small collection of just 125 rooms and suites keep the resort from feeling crowded, even during peak summer months.</li> <li>At more than 500 square feet, entry-level rooms are spacious with a separate living area, desk, and furnished patio or balcony.</li> <li>The centerpiece of this Mallorca escape is the three-tiered Cascade Pool, with plenty of plush loungers, attentive staff, and a poolside restaurant.</li> <li>The resort’s spa is one of the largest on the island, boasting more than 50,000 square feet of amenities like an Egyptian brine bath, hydropool, ice cave, and jet showers.</li> <li>The property caters to families with large suites, dedicated kids’ pools, and the curated Explorer’s Club with educational activities around the resort.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>All accommodations feature a private sea-facing terrace or balcony as a standard feature across the property.</li> <li>Suites up the luxury ante with deep-soaking tubs, expanded living space, and dedicated 24-hour butler service.</li> <li>The resort is pet-friendly, offering dedicated services and amenities to ensure a comfortable stay for four-legged companions.</li> <li>House car services and dedicated concierge support are available to arrange golf outings and private island excursions.</li> <li>Multiple swimming pools and acres of manicured gardens make the resort feel like a completely private paradise.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Accommodations offer a contemporary take on Old World opulence with elegant contemporary furnishings and classic architectural details.</li> <li>Every guest room and suite includes a furnished private patio or terrace overlooking the grounds and the Mediterranean Sea.</li> <li>Spacious family suites offer over 800 square feet of living space with separate lounge areas and bedrooms.</li> <li>Marble bathrooms are equipped with deep-soaking tubs, walk-in rainfall showers, and premium bath amenities.</li> <li>In-room amenities include plush bathrobes, high-speed connectivity, Nespresso coffee makers, and intuitive digital controls.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The culinary crown jewel of the resort is Es Fum, an internationally acclaimed seasonal eatery serving elevated Spanish cuisine from April through October.</li> <li>Terra provides a casually elegant backdrop for Mediterranean cuisine with a local twist, featuring an airy dining room and garden terrace seating.</li> <li>Mar Sea Club offers a trendy alfresco beachfront spot for freshly caught seafood, champagne, oysters, caviar, and filling international mains.</li> <li>The resort bar features vibrant decor and a lively ambiance for pre-dinner cocktails or nightcaps, accompanied by a curated menu of tapas.</li> <li>In-room dining is available 24 hours a day, serving a full selection of regional dishes and international favorites directly to your room or terrace.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Bar, Beach, Fitness classes, Golf, Gym, House car service, Indoor pool, Kids Club, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Pet friendly, Restaurants, Spa, Arabella Spa, Three-tiered Cascade Pool, Egyptian brine bath, Hydropool, Ice cave, Jet showers, Sea-facing terraces, Explorer’s Club",649,849,"3,999","2,999",229,"3,999",109,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hzbXndv5dWCK5nJRTWroNdtfLI_e-JJk/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1u_Zbn1DFIEkRW8hhGjjLF9pLtd3ySgmE/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hzbXndv5dWCK5nJRTWroNdtfLI_e-JJk/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/13BUjSxpzXmG9YLSS3LQ5d7FFcbK_nL8E/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MbTrQw9YY0EFV5poJ3S4nvBx5KUa-avk/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/17W7vk-ydYB2UWCRtfM1oI3f9vgKF_4Cc/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wf8UNdmnePdk7UjHvpaCZbDRHXelxf0d/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bORAFuNqDLp6q6ynyM7Tewtlja3HOP12/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-Mjc1i8ZG_rik-kAbi-5ViT-5SUs9rEp/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zz_10GS843qXej--0CMdrputhrUxteWR/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mvs9tINY3hZP_HSiR-zr-BySP7W8heIH/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EpxrTkbKleQ19pysRiBdGyGLK4LkjPyL/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xmgmC61DgdGeyGJlj2fh7YxrPnoRHE_B/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UpkI_uorp60P12khmwMRUWD-eznfL3ra/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jLw1DEnoBMAc1XV9LqW6RXBBKiaQzd6c/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/19c_NTFQ2U4qDFQNLPmHSDJHbTR5z7xFN/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CbSkOVCQ8Xzp4atJBQKJ6fZ