Hanford Hotel & Resort Riviera Maya,Riviera Maya’s Exotic Hideaway,"Carretera Federal Chetumal-Puerto Juárez Km. 298 Playa del Carmen, Quintana Roo, Mexico",Mexico,North America,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Hotel & Resort Riviera Maya</h1> <h4><em><strong>Riviera Maya&rsquo;s exotic hideaway</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Located 25 minutes from trendy Playa del Carmen, Hanford Hotel and Resort Riviera Maya gives you a sense of place amid posh luxury, tucked away in a gorgeous resort community on Mexico’s Riviera Maya.</p> <p>The hideaway echoes the natural beauty and jungle mystique of its surroundings, from thick mangroves and underground waterways to ancient, indigenous traditions.&nbsp;</p> <p>Private villas built into the landscape dot the resort, while an award-winning golf course, beachfront club, and striking spa provide a wonderful opportunity to unwind.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The arrival experience sets a dramatic stage with a curving driveway leading through thick foliage to a stunning open-air lobby overlooking famous canals.</li> <li>Mayan-influenced architecture melds indoor and outdoor spaces beautifully using floor-to-ceiling windows, rustic woods, and muted earth tones.</li> <li>The spa incorporates an exotic jungle vibe with treatments taking place in private, over-the-water therapy villas administered by highly trained therapists.</li> <li>Sands Beach Club features a waterfront pool, swim-up bar, beach loungers, and complimentary snorkeling, stand-up paddleboarding, and kayaking equipment.</li> <li>A plethora of eateries offers an assortment of cuisines to suit all tastes, from authentic Thai dishes to contemporary Mexican fare and private boat dining.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>A complimentary shuttle and ferry service easily connects guests to nearby destinations and facilities across the wider resort complex.</li> <li>Golfers will love the nearby championship golf club designed by Greg Norman, featuring three distinct landscapes including jungle, mangrove, and sea.</li> <li>Guests can join daily eco boat tours with a resident biologist to explore the canal network and learn about local wildlife.</li> <li>Unique culinary events include an annual regional food festival featuring specialized cooking classes and curated dining experiences.</li> <li>Convenient resort-wide room charging allows guests to effortlessly experience various dining and leisure venues across the property.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Immense pool villas starting at over 2,750 square feet are built discreetly into the landscape along garden paths accessed via golf cart.</li> <li>Each villa features its own private full-sized pool, indoor and outdoor living areas, a private garden, and an alfresco bath.</li> <li>Opulent quarters like the Beachfront Three Bedroom Pool Villa offer direct ocean views, a heated swimming pool, courtyard, and jet pool.</li> <li>Guests can order an in-villa barbecue experience where a private chef brings a grill and prepares fresh prime cuts and seafood in your villa.</li> <li>Romantic bath packages allow guests to have a candlelit bath drawn under the stars complete with wine and rose-petal amenities.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Oriente serves Mexican fare and international breakfast spreads with custom cooking stations, transforming into a steakhouse in the evening.</li> <li>Cello brings authentic northern Italian cuisine with live handmade pasta stations set against waterside vistas and live electronic cello music.</li> <li>Saffron delivers authentic, flavor-packed Thai cuisine on a picturesque wooden deck surrounded by tranquil mangroves.</li> <li>Haab offers an exclusive five-course traditional Mayan dinner experience complete with a spiritual welcome ritual, storytelling, and dance performances.</li> <li>Ixchel provides a romantic private dining experience aboard a boat that leisurely cruises through canals and mangroves under the stars.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Babysitting services, Bar, Golf, Gym, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Restaurants, Spa, Tennis, Banyan Tree Spa, Private villa pools, Sands Beach Club, Waterfront pool with swim-up bar, Complimentary water sports (snorkeling, SUP, kayaking), El Camaleón PGA golf course, Daily eco boat tour, Private dining boat (Ixchel)",699,949,"5,499","4,499",299,"5,999",129,https://drive.google.com/file/d/13MTENj_cBLbYn1uNYDJsACn8QQgG8cMt/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/13MTENj_cBLbYn1uNYDJsACn8QQgG8cMt/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QvA0di5vasMqauUb8x2T-gvJz-mg42li/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tTLlYe7vJFZhykQ3Q-7Iovo6niJnvWne/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/18ah-ex2tfw1S0Pb8FoUDeGjQszwHDQyK/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YxL0EGxOWi4V5qP2PBm0DNGLSQjDkrnd/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1keHQwTg42wQXqHkD3WvAM2Othul8fuFJ/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LCFbwgaZmIZNfozxpv7AT-PS4s3I0nH3/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ICCV-he1pc72GYGwq_KoApxcRDGyMlvt/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HlJQveHCRbLtTHCVk5qs_g-_I6H2yknl/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ze1-nsSIJZkEmz-efOlkJPRS_OQVEuD-/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1G74hpPLJUOqivPgnk461t-DgvU4izCtW/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bewY0KfApVsaKJZK4hxkhta7a8g6M9pc/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1k6TLK55FlceN17GLFP_7d-jUCiwo7TgE/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/11z47cEyBv0rX0lzXB5uVS_UJKifPrtg0/view?usp=drive_link, 