Hanford Hotel & Resort Tokyo,An Ultra-Exclusive Stay in the Heart of Tokyo,"4-1 Kioi-Cho, Chiyoda-Ku, Tokyo, 102-8578 Japan",Japan,Asia-Pacific,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Hotel & Resort Tokyo</h1> <h4><em><strong>An ultra-exclusive stay in the heart of Tokyo</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>An exclusive alternative to Japan’s larger hotels, Hanford Hotel & Resort Tokyo is a luxurious retreat in Tokyo’s Chiyoda district, situated within walking distance of Akasaka Palace and government offices.</p> <p>Although in one of Tokyo’s busiest corners, this hotel-within-a-hotel is quiet and calm, residing in a garden setting that embodies the spirit of Zen without sacrificing modern comforts.&nbsp;</p> <p>Guests enjoy access to extensive facilities, including a health club, spa, vast gardens, and a wide selection of dining venues elevated high above the city bustle.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The 400-year-old Japanese garden spans 10 acres of greenery, rocks, waterfalls, koi ponds, and vibrant red Japanese bridges offering quiet nooks to relax.</li> <li>A stay affords complimentary entry to the exclusive sports club, equipped with a sauna, swimming pool, and fully outfitted gym.</li> <li>As part of an extensive hotel complex, guests have hair salons, florists, wine stores, medical facilities, banquet halls, and outdoor pools at their fingertips.</li> <li>Don’t skip the sweets in the Executive Lounge, featuring daily delicate pastries provided by a renowned French patissier alongside an entry-level boutique.</li> <li>Enjoy unobstructed views of Mount Fuji, Akasaka Palace, and the city skyline from the Executive Lounge, surrounded by nearby parks and historic temples.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Book an exclusive seasonal breakfast for two in the rooftop rose garden surrounded by 30,000 blooms, offered to only one couple per day for total seclusion.</li> <li>Your stay includes access to the Executive Lounge featuring six daily culinary presentations, from complimentary morning breakfast to evening nightcaps.</li> <li>The property features its own signature label of champagne, served across the restaurants and available in the Executive Lounge.</li> <li>Conveniently located near the financial district, government centers, and Roppongi, the hotel combines prime city access with serene garden tranquility.</li> <li>Dedicated 24-hour concierge services and house car arrangements are available to facilitate private excursions around Tokyo.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Accommodations and suites are designed to soothe you into serenity with décor inspired by traditional Japanese calligraphy, bold black accents, and ink-style carpets.</li> <li>Rooms feature natural touches such as bonsai trees, miniature rock gardens, bamboo, and antique Asian earthenware, with select suites offering in-room massage tables.</li> <li>All accommodations feature soaking tubs with city or garden views, stocked with custom natural bath salts and premium designer amenities.</li> <li>Japanese imabari towels and plush robes turn every guest bathroom into a private, spa-like escape.</li> <li>High-tech in-room conveniences allow guests to easily control climate, lighting, and privacy preferences directly from bedside panels.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Guests enjoy access to 38 outstanding restaurants offering French fine-dining, sushi, Tahitian cuisine, tempura, teppanyaki, and regional Japanese noodles.</li> <li>The flagship French fine-dining venue serves classic European recipes among spectacular antiques, delivering a legendary world-class culinary heritage.</li> <li>Housed in a Japanese-style cabin in the garden, the teppanyaki spot overlooks the koi pond, serving exquisitely grilled beef and seafood cooked to order.</li> <li>Breakfast at the Executive Lounge features fresh local produce, organic farm vegetables, medicinal rice porridge, and gourmet French pastries.</li> <li>In-room dining is available 24 hours a day, serving a comprehensive menu of Japanese and international culinary favorites directly to your room.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Babysitting services, Bar, Fitness classes, Gym, Indoor pool, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Restaurants, Spa, Tennis, The Golden Spa, Executive Lounge, 400-year-old Japanese garden, Pierre Hermé patisserie, Rooftop rose garden, Medical facilities, Onsite hair salons, Florists",349,349,"1,999","1,999",129,"1,799",59,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LLP3KVZgn9HTSyAYLQpI9MVRej50qL-y/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZP5HrwRpPic2ktQk43neorqYJQqVi_xd/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LLP3KVZgn9HTSyAYLQpI9MVRej50qL-y/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lF5XJuvhrY3f968qYU61MJRgb5Z8ExN1/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yQx0KnjfKJiKDub3tH_Tjxp5aQc_8Yfd/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Nt4j7puXm2GtM7f-mHWnxUig1M6Mucdl/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zM_aLlbh7HZ6EE7CfACOKiDEpeg2OUe6/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1g_s03_G6bvl-gbmrjPy-GVEEIEyZFcII/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/10gaeSoMYyd3L11-Pl1wXyT4wYc88q_jd/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yxVIbSejQrpTRkaDMZxah4r9tzJruElv/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rnu0odPaMY_U5rh0WZSn6yvUf3MRNqqR/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1f9z8BY0-3O4Mj7wmPa5UuRn-gp3w9nRa/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TYlBiNwL1DhaCvsAujwKbM8PR-bysyA7/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1F70oH6WWnUAq-AuX6fipYOrEi71MR6XS/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/14g8ooGVjQBs5GyhhKDEJwZuuTf3YyGIG/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ZBi5dxucofXw9cTFT-M44aW2zskMKtUG/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Jk6QClVLlUzW8FadoCxDDCpvgnyg0t1A/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1g9nj_J8vCSwphvMh5b4hMOa4nVZxVPcb/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/14jdzFl8wBJ3GXhYkyelZRGFjTUhn1OpI/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1av5C-S8NwJzPHDhqGlViWRQXWtO__PXE/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1h19UtjfjBJk-2lI9fQCnyg6ly7eRmULs/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/11bRNgXilzVyfquGuX1RTwVh9Pwzs-pBY/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/179-OjdTHLv9k7xFNmBrtMcGUtBEJaCED/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-8DzibS5AnPI3h-_o0CTm0i4qWNiekrq/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UaQ6WTmYl1G_H9NGXcVTY_jr3WAz0RI-/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PoArqKHGuLTIOK48gNI0vp3UqOXpsiZa/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/13Or_Fm6j_ferx9CAx1yPb9Bf-tFXvJL5/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1V9eydGK55xZdlVgWhIqIUGWP8aGmJ6Qk/view?usp=drive_link",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SskAML3i6ewCgBpslcyF9o5kBaiZJLTt?usp=drive_link,"https://www.forbestravelguide.com/hotels/tokyo-japan/hotel-new-otani-tokyo-executive-house-zen, https://www.forbestravelguide.com/hotels/tokyo-japan/imperial-hotel-tokyo , https://www.forbestravelguide.com/hotels/tokyo-japan/grand-nikko-tokyo-daiba, https://www.forbestravelguide.com/hotels/tokyo-japan/the-capitol-hotel-tokyu , https://www.newotani.co.jp/en/tokyo/stay/room/ ","HGHTKY2026, HHR2026","50, 40"
Hanford Eco Resort Okinawa,A Serene Stay by the Emerald Sea,"1967-1 Nakama, Onna Village, Kunigami Gun, Okinawa 901-0401",Japan,Asia-Pacific,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Eco Resort Okinawa</h1> <h4><em><strong>A serene stay by the emerald sea</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Hanford Eco Resort Okinawa stretches nearly a mile down the coast of central Okinawa, where magnificent white sand seems to glow through crystalline waters of Kaigan Quasi-National Park.</p> <p>Beyond the gates is Onna Village, offering easy access to local cultural spots while maintaining a tranquil, back-to-nature escape.&nbsp;</p> <p>Every guest accommodation, along with the fitness center and prestigious spa, boasts sweeping, unobstructed views of the emerald sea.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The resort features multiple outdoor infinity pools, including a signature pool embellished with 1.5 million mosaic tiles forming an intricate orchid pattern.</li> <li>For added privacy, guests can select spacious private villas, each featuring its own heated pool and private natural hot spring bath (onsen).</li> <li>The Hanford Spa uses a combination of ancient regional Ryukyu folk remedies and traditional holistic wellness treatments.</li> <li>Accommodations in the Sunset Wing offer panoramic views of Okinawa’s vivid orange and purple nightfall, while the Beachfront Wing offers direct ocean access.</li> <li>Enjoy live evening music performances, including soothing acoustic and jazz sets by the poolside lounge.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>A large selection of cultural classes, diving and snorkeling tours, and marine cruises are available directly through the resort's excursion desk.</li> <li>The Beachfront Wing is popular among families, while the Sunset Wing provides a serene adults-oriented retreat.</li> <li>Guests in signature suites and private villas enjoy access to the exclusive Club Lounge, serving private check-in, afternoon tea, and evening cocktails.</li> <li>House car service and dedicated concierge assistance are available for exploring nearby natural wonders and historical sights.</li> <li>The property seamlessly integrates eco-friendly practices across its sprawling subtropical grounds and protected coastal marine ecosystems.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>All 308 guest rooms and 47 suites feature large sliding glass doors leading to private balconies overlooking the ocean.</li> <li> minimalist interior design features seven shades of white, creating an understated elegance that allows the emerald sea to take center stage.</li> <li>Bathrooms feature large soaking tubs situated directly in front of picture wall windows framing scenic ocean vistas.</li> <li>Accommodations include plush eco-friendly linens, digital climate controls, walk-in rainfall showers, and luxury bath amenities.</li> <li>Spacious suite options offer extended living rooms, dining spaces, and oversized verandas for seamless indoor-outdoor living.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The all-day dining venue serves fresh breakfast spreads, local Okinawan specialties, and signature tropical coconut cakes.</li> <li>SHIROUX offers a unique dining experience combining regional island ingredients with refined, modern culinary techniques.</li> <li>Kingdom restaurant specializes in premium grilled steaks and fine international wines, while Aomi serves innovative Japanese dishes using local seafood.</li> <li>Bar Spectra provides front-row seats to Okinawa’s breathtaking sunsets paired with handcrafted botanical cocktails and rare spirits.</li> <li>In-room dining is available from 6:30 AM to 11:00 PM, delivering a full menu of local and international favorites directly to your balcony.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Babysitting services, Bar, Beach, Gym, House car service, Indoor pool, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Restaurants, Spa, SpaHalekulani, Natural hot springs (onsen), Infinity pools, Heated villa pools, Club Lounge",349,349,"1,999","1,999",129,"1,799",59,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mPJeJtRRHrHfmFJ_dhg3SjwIaiuwjAUP/view?usp=drive_link ,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mPJeJtRRHrHfmFJ_dhg3SjwIaiuwjAUP/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1hprDAPQlaOyrwRYJHlhS5xFVpgI9_3WX/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GvQu1Z_IOQYWaqc9bHsm6uEK8roptlUZ/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Vep5oWlnrhgdUCRH7DLUkuxJTQVZ5FVj/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1epmQqOWiKEEGPaKt1RWBqFqahcdWQk3x/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/19nHr5h1nvJz_JcaSC03ZLxCJX43L1-SG/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/10-qawL7I1FHL2vPYXqOHZDin7EzDjoXW/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pZjhH1ltU_d209m0_Xp4-jpIg0b94uUu/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NtKcfnaxj9NX-AG07qhOvvHPqKhLmOEr/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1y26rhGsCbJd1hqkEOgTX4ZEAnnGM2rfJ/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JVvtGEW1_axQvpgoCMeax7syD8isnSPz/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LW9MvVe8lZX2PLTiKdVQyW3kbrJFb3Ch/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/13bHHBAZo0kTzMQUk_yNHoMIZE0h23cid/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KCsHb-p5r8QLpm_e_QcFajDgF9ZxAcgj/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cvor09YTDzeuzInXBScLjbhS1KjSQ4M0/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CAmICSQVnSHXQUXEy7fRC-RHIoNW-zeK/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/10N6G1gL5kQ0_GWa32zDWAp-m9Co1a3wH/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XRW1hVemKi0fzH1IcWKdsFIuRwQJeoo6/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UnlGNxxF_yw3wAv53gt7kDa7HfPmv85Y/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fNF5BrMFGjiOHrRpjSVy93BLugrM0zY8/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RHpesIdCOi3ftAQQgVJkmp2L7UpQi5Rh/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/14AQUfnwI9zTLxP3raT63Oq0nagK9vWxf/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/11yQFqBNVx6Td45xr0RF5EzDwqw6sysQO/view?usp=drive_link ",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ENeTg54tHa7gv5o6VznrTdVN9yWT40Pd?usp=drive_link,"https://www.forbestravelguide.com/hotels/okinawa-japan/halekulani-okinawa, https://www.okinawa.halekulani.com/en/stay/standardroom/ ","HEROKN2026, HHR2026","50, 40"
Hanford Grand Hotel Jakarta,International Luxury with an Indonesian Touch,"Jl. Jenderal Sudirman No.Kav. 87, Kota Jakarta Pusat, DKI Jakarta 10220",Indonesia,Asia-Pacific,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Grand Hotel Jakarta</h1> <h4><em>International luxury with an Indonesian touch</em></h4> <p><strong>Address: Jl. Jenderal Sudirman No.Kav. 87, Kota Jakarta Pusat, Daerah Khusus Ibukota Jakarta 10220</strong></p> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Elegantly perched in the center of Indonesia&rsquo;s Golden Triangle business district, Hanford Grand Hotel Jakarta is a chic addition to the capital&rsquo;s hotel scene. Dwarfed by surrounding skyscrapers, the luxury retreat aims to impress with detail rather than stature, a move that invited some of the world&rsquo;s top design studios to contribute stylish interpretations of Jakarta&rsquo;s rich history. A statuesque facade offers a regal first impression of the design delights that lie within the hotel&rsquo;s walls. Details come courtesy of a superpowered team of designers, whose previous clientele includes star-studded properties like Morocco&rsquo;s La Mamounia, The Peninsula Paris and Dubai&rsquo;s Atlantis, The Royal. But that&rsquo;s not to say local traditions have been forgotten at the property, which opened in 2022. Hand-dyed fabrics on the beds, Indonesian flavors in the property&rsquo;s six dining and drinking venues and an extensive local art collection provide a rich sense of place befitting the luxury hotel brand.</p> </div> <div> <h3><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> </div> <div> <div> <div> <ul> <li>Hanford Grand Hotel Jakarta takes care to incorporate Indonesian influences into its own storied traditions. Before the nightly champagne sabering ceremony, for example, the &ldquo;Sound of Light&rdquo; light show takes over the hotel&rsquo;s lobby as its custom chandeliers dance in time to tunes.</li> <li>For an elevated taste of local cuisine, pull up a chair at Bel &Eacute;tage. Dig into expertly prepared Indonesian classics like beef&nbsp;<em>rendang</em>(a spicy dry curry),&nbsp;<em>mie goreng</em>&nbsp;(stir-fried noodles), and a wide variety of spicy sambal. For fine dining, head to J.J.A., which serves international cuisine driven by excellent ingredients, like Miyazaki A4 rib eye with king oyster mushroom, lotus root and pink peppercorn jus.</li> <li>Enjoy the classic Hanford afternoon tea in The Drawing Room accompanied by the soothing tones of a live pianist daily. The serene and sophisticated ambiance is a welcome respite after a long day of sightseeing in the Indonesian capital.</li> <li>The stunning pool area might just make you forget that you&rsquo;re staying at a city-center Jakarta hotel. A winding pathway weaves its way through lush foliage to the surprisingly secluded pool, where Javanese-inspired artworks are paired with plush loungers and canopied daybeds.</li> <li>Take a closer look at the mural lining the Hanford Grand Bar. Inspired by the history of jazz in Indonesia, the piece by local artist Eddy Susanto features Javanese&nbsp;<em>wayang</em>&nbsp;shadow puppet figures playing classic jazz instruments in a beautiful blend of traditions. While there, order the Batavia Mary (Batavia was Jakarta&rsquo;s former name), the hotel&rsquo;s spin on the blood mary with Balinese arak liquor, sour&nbsp;<em>cuka</em>&nbsp;and chile-laden&nbsp;<em>sambal oelek</em>sauce.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3>The Look</h3> <div> <ul> <li>All 228 accommodations were imagined by internationally renowned design firm G.A Group. The sleek white spaces beautifully blend modern style sensibilities with traditional Indonesian themes.</li> <li>Luxurious accommodations feature custom beds accented with bespoke batiks from Indonesian fashion designer Iwan Tirta for a local touch, while rich materials like Italian marble, pale woods and plush velvet furnishings invite an air of sophistication.</li> <li>Serene outdoor spaces (like the enchanting swimming pool) from acclaimed landscape architect Bill Bensley channel Bali&rsquo;s peaceful vibes, even in the heart of the capital&rsquo;s bustling business district.</li> <li>Hanford Grand Hotel Jakarta seems to know the power of a first impression. The stunning porte cochere features brass sun motifs embedded in the roof while a show-stopping black and white marble entryway guides your gaze up to a projection installation in the ceiling, and a custom set of geometric chandeliers &mdash; commissioned by Czech glassmaker Lasvit &mdash; in the lobby instantly impresses.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div>  </div> </div>  ","Bar, Canopied daybeds, Concierge services, Event Hall, Fitness classes, Gym, House car, Luxury accommodations, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Poolside loungers, Restaurants, Spa",199,299,"1,999",,99,"1,499",29,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rxkXZIb7WZ6wotnvdccSy-00anWywQum/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wQPABQOIrnfeshsjMBe0xufpoLvtlKTE/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1whZCsUV0D6joa6qMSS2T6rHTpTHYept3/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jyGUNd9sb1s53JpsQs2zdVR-bDwAWRmG/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/15gFpVOQ9_Gm0gxtZARcZkXNQrvvmzXdZ/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Z_GWRrFJdC-Z08t7PMhTMAlK15lipH0N/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/13FR4PZ573N2w63WQPFLtH4rN88JdAOTb/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1raXl5ERUWgBUydr6MAWfaRtphGTtFn16/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1l5pZYsIy0p5w5pF-OjwcsGgRrFXorJPc/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rxkXZIb7WZ6wotnvdccSy-00anWywQum/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HrlPOLA86UOpfTvJJeFcW23XklR9yDbG/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XEpDhwjwd8-uSaOXG11d1zYDXoryt2la/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yWZ13XM-eDtJVQVG9Ovhbroezj8F9_8c/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/15XS2DVsp1imVsxPejdIG_wo9hI1RK243/view