"Hanford Eco Resort Nusa Dua, Bali",Bali’s Secret Beachfront Oasis,"Jl. Raya Nusa Dua Selatan Kawasan Sawangan, Nusa Dua Bali, Indonesia 80363",Indonesia,Asia-Pacific,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Eco Resort Nusa Dua, Bali</h1> <h4><em><strong>Bali&rsquo;s secret beachfront oasis</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>As far as memorable first impressions go, Hanford Eco Resort Nusa Dua, Bali dazzles from the moment you arrive. Passing through the grand entrance and chapel surrounded by reflecting pools, the dramatic resort landscape unfolds like a secret oceanfront oasis.</p> <p>The resort is the epitome of elegance and sophistication, offering an eco-conscious sanctuary nestled within 74 acres of lush coastal grounds.&nbsp;</p> <p>With ultra-luxurious accommodations, Jacuzzi-clad balconies in every suite, 24-hour butler service, and an iconic beachfront infinity pool, this resort offers an unforgettable retreat.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The signature beachfront Oasis pool is one of the most picturesque infinity pools on the island, ideal for swimming laps or relaxing in private cabanas.</li> <li>The Wellness Suite at the spa features a Finnish sauna, an aroma steam room, chromatherapy light therapy, and an ice room with a crystal ice fountain.</li> <li>Located in the prestigious Nusa Dua enclave, the resort is situated near cultural landmarks like Geger Temple and the clifftop Uluwatu Temple.</li> <li>The majority of the resort's luxurious suites face the shimmering Indian Ocean, while others overlook beautifully landscaped tropical gardens.</li> <li>Guests enjoy access to exclusive dining lounges offering complimentary daily afternoon tea, handcrafted cocktails, and fine culinary experiences.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Exploring beyond Nusa Dua is seamless via private house car services and the Mandara toll road spanning the Gulf of Benoa.</li> <li>The resort offers a variety of beachfront water sports tailored to all skill levels, including canoeing and stand-up paddleboarding.</li> <li>Dedicated 24-hour personal butler service is available to handle every detail of your stay, from private dining to local excursion bookings.</li> <li>Multiple swimming pools and expansive garden grounds ensure a private, serene atmosphere throughout the property.</li> <li>Sustainable eco-luxury practices are integrated across the resort's guest facilities, energy management, and marine conservation programs.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>All suites feature exquisite interiors with gold accents, plush beds with up to 1,000-thread-count linens, fine artwork, and private Jacuzzis on the patio.</li> <li>Sliding glass doors open to spacious outdoor verandas equipped with comfortable seating nooks and sweeping garden or ocean vistas.</li> <li>Expanded two-bedroom suite options include a separate luxurious living room, formal dining area, and expanded private outdoor space.</li> <li>Bathrooms feature marble double-sink vanities, high-tech digital Japanese toilets, separate walk-in rain showers, and premium bath products.</li> <li>In-room technology includes digital climate controls, high-speed Wi-Fi, Nespresso coffee machines, and intuitive bedside lighting panels.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The main café serves a lavish international buffet with interactive live cooking stations and a dedicated gourmet dessert room.</li> <li>Specialty dining options include Cantonese and Szechuan fine dining at Table8 and authentic Japanese delicacies at Edogin.</li> <li>Soleil focuses on a Mediterranean and pan-Asian menu featuring handmade pasta, premium grilled meats, fresh local seafood, and a famous Sunday brunch.</li> <li>Five stylish bars and lounges provide ideal spots for social sips, from oceanfront drinks at Sky Bar to live evening entertainment and music.</li> <li>In-room dining is available 24 hours a day, serving a comprehensive menu of regional and international specialties directly to your private terrace.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Bar, Beach, Fitness classes, Gym, House car service, Meeting rooms, Nightclub, Outdoor pool, Restaurants, Spa, Tennis, Mulia Spa, Wellness Suite (Finnish sauna, Aroma steam room, Ice room), Oasis beachfront pool, Private Jacuzzi balconies, Exclusive Lounge, 24-hour butler service, Complimentary water sports",299,449,"2,499","1,999",129,"2,499",39,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xJdvOexY6n65yUVWosZpQfQkcHnA1cWf/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/11XkBc2FlDnj_OSpvGETUypl-5IDA46bQ/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Yi_75e48cFRc19FrBrci5QideDSr7A00/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mvccn8xemojbZs3Io7Ix279tijUyi2dA/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yYZOKXlUpoifL2Tiq-WWxbgJU9j9ZB15/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NpwkE29snmVQXcaK3ahLEfyea4lAJv24/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nEbl4e_d-1LNVCwX6bPijBShT7y5RXSt/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yZV1jWtRI2cSfcopuxmd7LlyNYo_tksS/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iDcr5dfWSfG4PW3VItviO1uacgyKiVuS/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uc04ohG1vtrhNtd49yZhqtYkecepURHK/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TnG3JURYde41poQ5QZ2-RecWUiX-1QW3/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ba1k1LpOYMH6pVoRfgFzDUTJn1LnWhDf/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ghowIBRi48OixES9enENYV-kE8Pq7PCi/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eEtzJmRoXVqdT6vT4hnbhaIwApv1r7mx/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1emyHmZ5lPMSW1Hxc-CQ8yKe0wvRow6yn/view?usp=drive_