Hanford Grand Hotel London,Timeless British Elegance in the Heart of London,"25 Grosvenor Square, Mayfair, London W1K 6JP",United Kingdom,Europe,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Grand Hotel London</h1> <h4><em><strong>Sleek style in London's Knightsbridge</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Everything about Hanford Grand Hotel London exudes refined glamour and sophistication, from seductive public spaces designed by world-renowned architects to its prime location in the heart of fashionable Knightsbridge.</p> <p>Here in London’s poshest neighborhood, a veritable labyrinth of upscale shopping possibilities await, be it scores of smart boutiques or famed luxury department stores.&nbsp;</p> <p>Opened on the fringes of Hyde Park, this swanky hotel seamlessly blends modern luxury with world-class hospitality and high-end design.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Book one of the palatial suites to splash out in serious style, featuring fully equipped kitchens, expansive dining rooms, and private steam facilities.</li> <li>For a bit of pampering, head to the hotel’s spa, a 22,000-square-foot oasis &mdash; one of the largest in central London &mdash; sprawling across two full floors.</li> <li>Enjoy access to a cutting-edge fitness center offering comprehensive wellness assessments and individualized exercise and nutrition plans.</li> <li>Film buffs will love the hotel’s private Cinema, a state-of-the-art screening room with space for up to 47 moviegoers along with gourmet snacks.</li> <li>Savor authentic Italian cuisine at Sette by Scarpetta, a modern Italian dining spot that brings refined New York culinary concepts to London.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>For a luxurious smoking experience, visit the onsite specialty cigar shop to select from a collection of rare and hard-to-find Havanas.</li> <li>The private screening room and Cinema can be booked in advance with access to a library of over 300 thoughtfully selected movie titles.</li> <li>Situated in Knightsbridge, the hotel offers direct walking access to iconic shopping destinations and the green expanse of Hyde Park.</li> <li>The property provides dedicated concierge services to arrange private dining, personal shopping, and tailored local city excursions.</li> <li>Guests can enjoy an exclusive, intimate subterranean atmosphere across the lounge, bar, and wellness facilities.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Modern comforts mingle with timeless style and elegance across the hotel’s 85 contemporary guest rooms and lavish suites.</li> <li>Each accommodation offers luxurious touches like custom leather-bound travel-trunk minibars stocked with high-quality artisanal goodies.</li> <li>Cushioned headboards and damask silk curtains feature intricate embroidery reminiscent of fine designer craftsmanship.</li> <li>Spacious black-marble bathrooms feature premium fixtures, walk-in rainfall showers, and opulent bath amenities.</li> <li>Advanced room controls allow guests to effortlessly customize lighting, temperature, and privacy settings from the comfort of their beds.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Sette by Scarpetta serves breakfast, lunch, and dinner, plus daily aperitivo with cicchetti and signature drinks at its stylish bar.</li> <li>A private dining room is available for intimate gatherings and special parties of up to 18 guests.</li> <li>With an open fireplace and comfortable Italian furnishings, The Lounge offers a chic space for coffee, light bites, and daily housemade pastries.</li> <li>Nolita Social is the underground bar and lounge bringing NYC energy to London with craft cocktails, live music, and spinning DJs.</li> <li>Room service is available 24/7, providing access to the