Hanford Grand Hotel Madrid,An Urban Hideaway with Madrid History,"Calle de Sevilla, 3, 28014 Madrid, Spain",Spain,Europe,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Grand Hotel Madrid</h1> <h4><em><strong>An urban hideaway with history</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>With one hand extending back to a simpler time and another pointing squarely into the future, Hanford Grand Hotel Madrid sits at the crossroads of sublimity. Walking into the grand foyer adorned in marble, guests are immediately struck by classic ornamental elements and geometric shapes.</p> <p>Housed within the elaborate Centro Canalejas project at the corner of Calle de Sevilla and Calle de Alcal&aacute;, this 200-room architectural palace seamlessly blends historic 19th-century grandeur with modern luxury.&nbsp;</p> <p>From top-floor culinary destinations to Spain&rsquo;s largest spa sanctuary, the property gracefully unites timeless heritage with contemporary sophistication.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>More than 16,000 original historical features, including lamps, slate roofs, and windows, were meticulously restored and reused throughout the property.</li> <li>The property showcases an impressive 2,000-piece art collection featuring paintings, photography, graphic works, and bold contemporary statues in the lobby lounge.</li> <li>Said to be Spain&rsquo;s largest wellness sanctuary, the four-floor spa offers restorative massages, hydrating facials, couples sessions, and a sunlit indoor pool.</li> <li>Stay active at the state-of-the-art fitness center, offering one-hour yoga sessions and personalized training classes.</li> <li>Dani Brasserie on the top floor offers unparalleled morning views, scrumptious tapas lunches, and a lively evening dining atmosphere.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Once a historic main bank hall, the breathtaking two-story lobby is crowned overhead by stained glass crafted by the renowned Casa Maumejean family.</li> <li>Situated within the seven-building Centro Canalejas complex, guests have direct access to luxury retail shops, a gallery, and a gourmet food market.</li> <li>Kilometre Zero, the point where all distances in Spain are measured, is mere steps away, with major museums, parks, and the Royal Palace under a 20-minute walk.</li> <li>Guests can utilize the hotel&rsquo;s signature red Porsche Panamera house car for stylish local transfers","24-hour room service, Babysitting services, Bar, Gym, House car service, Indoor skylit pool, Meeting rooms, Pet friendly, Restaurants, Spa, Four-floor urban spa, Sauna and steam rooms, Hydro pool, Hair salon and nail corner, Rooftop brasserie and terrace, Luxury shopping gallery access, Yoga and personal training classes",599,799,"4,499",,299,"5,499",129,https://drive.google.com/file/d/16UH9H2UKXOIUyF6P2XiZjYusG8WTGNC0/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/16UH9H2UKXOIUyF6P2XiZjYusG8WTGNC0/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uQVdvavki5ZRaVVN8v489QYYpcQ3yRIS/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Xb3RVvTmruTWvDgbffDzSQ2CfWP5O9fT/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RVMQbmvkZv68yGMTayDBFSU7cdAy-XCr/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1j71K1EU2_35JTOOaQpJipPMWL7-DFty-/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/14b8fWNdqH6hSjbqRjWwQ1C6c5Qj-wHDC/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NuPeqPO-MOhd2fr-o4YN703BRywoURbk/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wRc6kZsfuY5vBWbHI-VXSDOVnPnt4oMq/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FHwEpNU9p9X5DiWwRLseXz64DlrCszhy/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_czYjfDu-xvDn-pI6CemcguZYUpto1G3/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RdrDbAyGP_VitHWckN_zdcg55t8RTbd2/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bv0qdsRnm4PatQ2eVRQzJVE2UBzoTFYT/v