Hanford Grand Hotel Montreal,European Elegance in the Heart of Québec,"1440 Rue de la Montagne, Montreal, QC H3G 1Z5 Canada",Canada,North America,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Grand Hotel Montreal</h1> <h4><em><strong>Montreal&rsquo;s newest luxury hot spot</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Hanford Grand Hotel Montreal is a rose-hued oasis for the city’s foodies, design lovers and world travelers alike, located in Montreal’s prestigious Golden Square Mile.</p> <p>Keeping with that shining tradition, the luxury lifestyle property has made a name for itself with its distinguished dining, trendy after-work patio scene, and jaw-dropping décor featuring wood, velour, and elegant pink hues.&nbsp;</p> <p>Step into the day and night lounges on opposite sides of a marble-footed wraparound bar to find yourself in a boudoir-inspired enchanted forest atmosphere.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The 18-story building features a striking modern black glass façade that stands out in the heart of downtown Montreal.</li> <li>The third-floor reception area and Social Square encompass a day lounge flowing into a night lounge with an adjacent restaurant and year-round patio.</li> <li>Social Square features custom forest-green wallpaper and hand-cut crystal window panels that create a sparkling floor-to-ceiling 3D effect overlooking Rue de la Montagne.</li> <li>Indulge in a hot stone massage, Rose Gold Hydrating Facial, or a Kneipp hydrotherapy session with hot and cold pools at the onsite Hanford Spa.</li> <li>The hotel is home to seafood-focused fine dining, incredible lounge spaces, and direct connectivity to premier local luxury shopping.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Book a room on the ninth floor or higher to view the inner atrium featuring dangling white and gold-tipped glass petals reflecting light from the ninth to 18th floors.</li> <li>Guests can request a room with views overlooking the famous nearby Leonard Cohen mural.</li> <li>The night lounge features white velvet banquettes and transforms into a speakeasy atmosphere in the evening with live DJ sets from a marble-lined booth.</li> <li>In-room bars are stocked with local artisanal spirits, premium beverages, luxury champagne, caramel corn, and chocolates.</li> <li>The property features a 5,800-square-foot ballroom and direct connection from the third-floor lobby to premier luxury department store shopping.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Elegant accommodations feature floor-to-ceiling windows, dark hardwood furniture, marble showers, four-poster beds, and complimentary yoga mats.</li> <li>A crystal wall separating the washroom and bedroom allows for stunning city views while relaxing in a standalone soaking tub.</li> <li>Lighting, room temperature, and window drapes are easily controlled using state-of-the-art in-room iPad touch controls.</li> <li>Curved-back lounge chairs and pink footstools complement the rosy, boudoir-inspired interior design elements.</li> <li>Guests can easily set privacy preferences and notify cleaning staff directly through the bedside digital control system.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The signature hotel restaurant and terrace put sustainable seafood at the forefront, featuring three-tier raw bar towers, fresh local salmon, and artisanal pasta dishes.</li> <li>The restaurant features a glass-walled curing room where housemade seafood charcuterie is sliced fresh to order.</li> <li>An exceptional wine cellar offers curated champagne selections, fine vintages, and smoky signature craft cocktails.</li> <li>A curated playlist controls the ambiance across the main dining room, open-air terrace, and day and night lounges.</li> <li>The popular after-work 