Hanford Grand Hotel Toronto,Toronto's Glamorous Boutique Beauty,"118 Yorkville Avenue, Toronto, Ontario M5R 1C2",Canada,North America,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Grand Hotel Toronto</h1> <h4><em><strong>Toronto&rsquo;s glamorous boutique beauty</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Located in the heart of Toronto’s glamorous Yorkville neighborhood, Hanford Grand Hotel Toronto is one of the finest boutique hotels in the city. Inspired by vintage Hollywood grandeur, the hotel welcome guests into an atmosphere of understated elegance.</p> <p>Bespoke services start upon arrival at the porte coch&egrave;re, where attentive staff, valets, and expert Clefs d’Or concierges attend to every detail with utmost exclusivity and discretion.&nbsp;</p> <p>Featuring sleek modern accommodations, a prestigious four-star spa, and a renowned signature restaurant, the hotel offers a sophisticated sanctuary in the heart of Yorkville.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The prestigious Yorkville Avenue address provides immediate access to high-end boutiques, art galleries, museums, fine dining, and cultural venues.</li> <li>One Restaurant offers exceptional culinary experiences, including a celebrated outdoor corner patio overlooking Yorkville Avenue and Hazelton Lane.</li> <li>The intimate spa features luxurious treatments, a 24-hour fitness center, and a heated saltwater pool with a sleek marble deck.</li> <li>The property showcases a curated collection of original artwork throughout public spaces, complete with dedicated art concierge services.</li> <li>Bathrooms feature green-flecked black granite, deep-soaking tubs, heated floors, rainfall showers, and mirror-embedded LCD televisions.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The hotel adheres to eco-friendly practices, including EV charging stations and a green roof to support urban environme