Hanford Hotel & Resort Whistler,A Classic Luxe Lodge in Any Season,"4599 Chateau Boulevard, Whistler, V8E 0Z5 Canada",Canada,North America,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Hotel &amp; Resort Whistler</h1> <h4><em><strong>A classic luxe lodge in any season</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Hanford Hotel &amp; Resort Whistler echoes the style of grand mountain lodges, offering classic luxury for an unforgettable getaway nestled right at the base of Blackcomb Mountain.</p> <p>From soaring wood-beamed ceilings in the lobby to its 550 guest rooms, the property exudes traditional warmth during both snow-filled winters and warm-weather months.&nbsp;</p> <p>Featuring a premier pool complex, diverse dining options, and seamless access to mountain trails, the hotel serves as an idyllic alpine sanctuary.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The resort features a dedicated Experience Guide team organizing daily outdoor activities, including guided hikes, cycling tours, museum visits, and local tastings.</li> <li>The health club complex offers an indoor-outdoor pool, a heated 60-foot adults-only lap pool, four whirlpool tubs, a eucalyptus steam room, and mountain views.</li> <li>Guests can stay active with twice-daily yoga sessions, aquatic aerobic classes, two tennis courts, and a fully equipped fitness center.</li> <li>Complimentary equipment valet service safely stores and delivers ski gear, snowboards, mountain bikes, and golf clubs upon request.</li> <li>Portobello eatery serves casual gourmet comfort foods, famous artisanal doughnuts, and hearty daily breakfasts for active adventurers.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Complimentary house car services are available to provide guests with effortless transfers around the village and nearby destinations.</li> <li>Families can borrow outdoor sports gear such as soccer balls and frisbees, alongside a selection of classic board games for cozy indoor evenings.</li> <li>Fairmont Gold guests receive access to a dedicated eighth-floor private lounge with complimentary breakfast, afternoon hors d'oeuvres, and evening desserts.</li> <li>The property is ideally located steps from local cultural attractions, including the Squamish Lil’wat Cultural Centre and Audain Art Museum.</li> <li>Four-legged family members are welcomed with dedicated pet-friendly amenities and specialized services throughout their stay.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Guest rooms showcase a traditional mountain lodge style with warm wooden furnishings, down-filled duvets, and scenic alpine or forest views.</li> <li>The property offers a vast array of connecting room configurations, making it particularly convenient for traveling families and groups.</li> <li>Recently modernized bathrooms feature plush cotton bathrobes, walk-in rainfall showers, and signature luxury bath products.</li> <li>Upgraded suites range from spacious junior layouts with separate seating areas to grand two-bedroom suites with cozy fireplaces.</li> <li>All accommodations feature high-speed digital connectivity, Nespresso coffee machines, and intuitive bedside climate controls.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The Grill Room provides a sophisticated dining setting specializing in prime steaks, fresh seafood, and regional British Columbia produce.</li> <li>Portobello offers casual cafeteria-style dining, serving freshly baked goods, smoked meats, custom sandwiches, and hot drinks.</li> <li>The Mallard Lounge is the resort's premier gathering place for classic après-ski relaxation, handcrafted cocktails, and evening live entertainment.</li> <li>Guests can enjoy daily gourmet breakfast spreads, light lounge bites, and seasonal outdoor patio dining overlooking the mountain base.</li> <li>In-room dining is available 24/7, delivering a full menu of regional specialties and comfort foods directly to your room or suite.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Babysitting services, Bar, Golf, Gym, Indoor pool, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Pet friendly, Restaurants, Spa, Tennis, Indoor-outdoor swimming pool, Heated adults-only lap pool, Four whirlpool tubs, Eucalyptus steam room, Fairmont Gold private lounge, Daily yoga sessions, Aquatic aerobic classes, Complimentary ski/bike/golf valet service, Complimentary local car service",449,599,"2,999","2,199",189,"3,499",139,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1epy4540FTKrMpBJQKTzvVNCVdpmEEeh5/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BJPq7QZca4O2ppE79wKaUDQ50dVtqXVb/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1epy4540FTKrMpBJQKTzvVNCVdpmEEeh5/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zXALmV-TUfxXVKbsOAej5TW6hJ1Vaqax/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lC1eRBn9V7OsKaYk3eBGRItHitlmPNdz/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MfDERnVF1cg63IpNWgCr6nm1h29BHpQV/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RmiFgzt6Ypvm0e41VaCjy-OCF2jr_PZI/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bFQx5rDHXIceTcnd7VifMG_bd9YQR1vw/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DKmPx4agxg4FhK4CAb0GlouL93wgUMAJ/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RAKd01P4XKzzVu8vw6sicznZjhY5UXSj/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RWHtK73tIMaPHJYLJwgqqDWigY-zYRLF/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jEbBU81MOMgJJ1IeSo4UkBfx6aJrL7g2/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yO-XaL4pgy9rALDzpRPJiLQAhCG6h_ae/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1atM75G6Qd3Dw_-P8GqqINUSk7JQjTeDp/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1m-SwjOA26ic70vF6SHuIXK7Dns1aCzTe/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1LF--WBGkw50M95x6Qpw-AsB