Hanford Grand Hotel New York,Timeless Sophistication in the Heart of New York,"50 Central Park South, New York, New York 10019",United States,North America,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Grand Hotel New York</h1> <h4><em><strong>Traditional New York style and understated elegance</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Traditional New York style and understated elegance surround you at every corner of Hanford Grand Hotel New York, set in a Beaux-Arts inspired building featuring dramatic crystal chandeliers, marble staircases, and soaring ceilings.</p> <p>The graceful hotel blends clean lines with subdued colors, brought to life through strategically placed contemporary artwork and vibrant floral arrangements.&nbsp;</p> <p>While the design is breathtaking, the hotel&rsquo;s exceptional level of personalized service and prime Midtown Manhattan location truly set it apart.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Experience state-of-the-art room technology, featuring flat-screen TVs and intuitive digital control panels for temperature, lighting, audio, and privacy settings.</li> <li>Unwind at the spa, offering cozy relaxation lounges, fluffy duvet-covered beds, eucalyptus steam rooms, saunas, and premium facial and body treatments.</li> <li>Enjoy the 22nd-floor indoor pool featuring relaxing chaise lounges, sweeping views of Fifth Avenue, and a seasonal outdoor sun deck.</li> <li>Stay active at the fitness center, complete with cardio and weight-training equipment, bamboo floors, and a separate studio for yoga and group classes.</li> <li>Guests booking suites gain exclusive access to chauffeured house car service using stylish Mini Cooper S Clubman vehicles for navigating New York’s streets.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Situated in Midtown Manhattan, lower-floor Grand Luxe rooms offer prime views of the vibrant hustle and bustle along Fifth Avenue.</li> <li>The property is exceptionally kid-friendly, offering customized New York tours, interactive culinary classes, junior afternoon tea, and young guest menus.</li> <li>Wedding and honeymoon packages feature romantic suite enhancements, including rose petal turndown, chilled champagne, and chocolate-covered strawberries.</li> <li>Daily turndown service includes closed blackout curtains, warm lighting adjustments, fresh ice service, and premium bedtime bath amenities.</li> <li>Located within short walking distance of Broadway, Central Park, Museum of Modern Art (MoMA), Carnegie Hall, and luxury Fifth Avenue shopping.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The hotel offers 219 luxurious accommodations across 22 floors, including 54 spacious suites tailored for business and leisure travelers.</li> <li>Guest rooms range from cozy superior layouts to expansive Grand Luxe rooms featuring dedicated work desks and silent communications equipment.</li> <li>Marble bathrooms are appointed with black granite countertops, deep-soaking tubs, separate walk-in showers, and luxury bath products.</li> <li>The flagship penthouse suite spans 3,300 square feet, featuring two bedrooms, a grand piano, private library, living and dining areas, and a Jacuzzi.</li> <li>All accommodations feature classic neutral tones, refined wood accents, and high-tech convenience controls right at your bedside.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Clement restaurant serves a fresh, contemporary American menu using locally sourced seasonal ingredients from the surrounding region.</li> <li>The Gotham Lounge hosts the famous signature Afternoon Tea, alongside a specialized junior tea service with sweet treats and hot cocoa for kids.</li> <li>Pen Top, the hotel&rsquo;s rooftop bar and lounge, offers craft cocktails and small plates accompanied 