Hanford Hotel & Resort Beverly Hills,Spanish Colonial Elegance in Tinseltown,"225 North Canon Drive, Beverly Hills, California 90210",United States,North America,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Hotel & Resort Beverly Hills</h1> <h4><em><strong>Spanish Colonial elegance in Tinseltown</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Located smack-dab in the middle of Beverly Hills' coveted Golden Triangle, Hanford Hotel &amp; Resort Beverly Hills embodies the height of luxury that defines the area.</p> <p>The property's entrance is on Canon Drive, and the Terrace restaurant overlooks the scenic Beverly Canon Gardens with white parasols and cascading fountains.&nbsp;</p> <p>Inside, spacious contemporary rooms with floor-to-ceiling windows and luxurious bathrooms welcome guests, topped by a rooftop pool with Hollywood Hills views.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The rooftop offers breathtaking views out to the Hollywood Hills, surrounding a blue-mosaic-tiled pool equipped with underwater music and private cabanas.</li> <li>Must-visit spots include the dedicated caviar and oyster bar, the main hotel bar, and an intimate Whisky Bar featuring rare aged scotches.</li> <li>Indulge in relaxation at the spa, featuring oxygen facials, Ayurveda immersion body treatments, and a comprehensive 24-hour fitness center.</li> <li>Situated just a few blocks from world-class shopping on Rodeo Drive and fine dining, with easy access to trendy West Hollywood destinations.</li> <li>Guests can experience authentic, one-of-a-kind activities in cuisine, mixology, cultural mural tours, and guided California city hikes.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The hotel sits directly in the Golden Triangle, within walking distance of high-end boutiques, galleries, and the lush Beverly Canon Gardens.</li> <li>Multiple dining venues offer culinary choices throughout the day, from rooftop specialty dining to casual café bites and evening cocktails.</li> <li>House car service and 24-hour concierge assistance are available to arrange private shopping excursions and Hollywood sightseeing tours.</li> <li>The property welcomes pets, offering dedicated amenities to ensure a comfortable stay for four-legged family members.</li> <li>Nearby cultural attractions include the Walk of Fame, Grauman’s Chinese Theatre, and luxury department stores along Wilshire Boulevard.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Newly renovated rooms and suites feature bright, spacious interiors with bespoke furniture and a soothing Californian pastel palette.</li> <li>Guest accommodations feature 500-thread-count Fili D'oro sheets and convenient bedside panels to easily control lighting and window curtains.</li> <li>Most rooms feature private furnished balconies, terraces, or patios overlooking the courtyard and California sunshine.</li> <li>Elegant bathrooms feature gorgeous beige and white mosaic wall tiling, deep-soaking tubs, walk-in showers, and luxury bath products.</li> <li>In-room amenities include 24-hour room service, high-speed digital controls, plush bathrobes, and stocked minibars.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Dante Beverly Hills on the rooftop offers fine Italian-inspired cuisine and world-renowned cocktails set against panoramic Hollywood Hills views.</li> <li>The Terrace overlooks the scenic Beverly Canon Gardens, serving fresh coastal dishes in a European piazza-style setting.</li> <li>The Maybourne Bar and dedicated caviar and oyster bar provide sophisticated spots for small bites and handcrafted drinks.</li> <li>The Whisky Bar offers an intimate setting for connoisseurs to sample rare, aged single malt whiskies.</li> <li>In-room dining is available 24 hours a day, bringing a full selection of gourmet dishes directly to your guest room or terrace.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Babysitting services, Bar, Gym, House car service, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Pet friendly, Restaurants, Spa, Spa at the Maybourne, Rooftop pool with cabanas, Underwater pool audio system, Caviar and oyster bar, The Whisky Bar, Coffee shop ",699,899,"5,499","4,499",329,"6,499",139,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Vqg8yy19E0DFSawsCBfs5LFLGkmreJN7/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YG3zBRKVOABK34CPS_aAGAvSorLK6Tuh/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Vqg8yy19E0DFSawsCBfs5LFLGkmreJN7/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/12e1gs_VD42DwT6JnvJl2l53bzBFl8jhE/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cbIbsq0roGixTDjDYf85q-gdkU6ylFtA/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cLQR_Qai97tp7161NUHoA-pbrH3kIg0Q/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1kR47i618pcUjjdnQf0FCNIew_-GkWzaF/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RD84pgTQaTcG6eOxe-DV5PXpVZrW7TCU/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FXcWFqTWmTSfYwgBOkI8D-hFxsUMOPC7/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mPLJgfLsKdDSUfVj2VDXA9YMnTXedpHb/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1NvpBlFtraUgzfD1uS0B5Mi9LoO4xBqjK/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DJZKnZf4N7cpun8EZKAqMnBO3_gobYB1/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AuuTH_d4SRLhgxy_CA668z2FOt_zd6f0/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1L4CJOEHCSgJZlS_eLNo20VTAiWkrHusu/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fJRoVYz7AfL795AynZ9gSMZyQ-tNerqI/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1mpwICb2k9HnVekhkLotgeai3-Kiu3Snv/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BL4TqCmbK8zpg4iBnyGBUkladbb81zM3/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MQKBpC7_FayfExJTtWFrdgHV2HzdHYOq/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/