"Hanford Hotel & Resort Maui, Hawaii",Where Luxury Meets the Spirit of Aloha,"3850 Wailea Alanui, Wailea, Hawaii 96753",United States,North America,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Hotel & Resort Maui, Hawaii</h1> <h4><em><strong>Maui's hottest pool scene</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>If you dream of a vacation where you’d while away the day at the pool, try Hanford Hotel & Resort Maui, Hawaii. The hotel boasts one of the most elaborate pools in Maui, where a river connects nine individual pools on six various levels.</p> <p>And if you prefer your pool time to be more sedate, swim over to the in-the-water Grotto Bar or escape from the fray and bask in the quiet of the adults-only Hibiscus Pool.&nbsp;</p> <p>When it’s time to get out of the pool, the beachfront Maui hotel offers plenty to keep you busy, including a 40-treatment-room spa and guided outrigger canoe experiences.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Peruse the paintings, sculptures, and murals strewn about the property, featuring an extensive fine art collection including signature bronze Fernando Botero sculptures.</li> <li>One of the key highlights of the resort is its 50,000-square-foot spa, providing a sizeable menu of treatments including facials, massages, and body therapies.</li> <li>A romantic al fresco dining experience awaits you at the resort's signature lagoon restaurant, where you can indulge in Hawaiian-inspired cuisine as you watch the sun set.</li> <li>Drop the kids off at the children’s camp &mdash; featuring a craft room, theater, game room, and outdoor play area &mdash; while you steal some alone time.</li> <li>Take advantage of the spa’s hydrotherapy circuit, featuring waterfalls that massage your neck and shoulders, tropical water jet showers, and essential oil baths.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>If you need guidance, join one of the resort's complimentary art tours or take classes like outdoor painting, outdoor photography, and watercolor painting.</li> <li>The Maui resort features a unique water elevator that brings you back up to the slide entrance across the expansive 25,700-square-foot pool area.</li> <li>Guests enjoy access to three 18-hole championship courses at the nearby Wailea Golf Club and 11 courts at the Wailea Tennis Club.</li> <li>The beachfront property features a charming chapel fronting a peaceful koi pond, making it an ideal setting for special occasions.</li> <li>Located in the exclusive Wailea area, the resort combines prime beachfront access with expansive tropical surroundings and world-class amenities.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The recently renovated accommodations carry a modern island vibe with a color palette drawn directly from Maui’s natural landscape.</li> <li>All light, airy rooms come with a private balcony or patio, sofa sleepers, a 55-inch HD television, a Keurig coffeemaker, and a marble bath with walk-in shower and tub.</li> <li>Try to snag a room in the exclusive Napua Tower, which features its own private check-in and dedicated concierge services.</li> <li>Guests in the Napua Tower enjoy complimentary continental breakfast along with cocktails and hors d’oeuvres in the early evening.</li> <li>Sustainable design elements are integrated throughout, including plush ocean-inspired artwork and eco-friendly furnishings.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The main dining venue features a romantic alfresco setting across a series of thatched-roof spaces floating serenely on a tropical lagoon.</li> <li>The signature dinner menu combines land and sea ingredients, offering local delicacies alongside premium steaks and fresh seared seafood.</li> <li>The Grand Dining Room serves daily breakfast accompanied by s