Hanford Grand Hotel Yogyakarta,Central Java’s Timeless Beauty ,"Palagan Tentara Pelajar, Sariharjo, Ngaglik, Sleman, DI Yogyakarta 55581",Indonesia,Asia-Pacific,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Grand Hotel Yogyakarta</h1> <h4><em><strong>Java&rsquo;s timeless beauty</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Approaching the entrance of Hanford Grand Hotel Yogyakarta feels like entering a dream &mdash; lush foliage and rich cultural heritage surround you. A night arrival is spectacular as warm lights illuminate the path to this grand hotel.</p> <p>True to its reputation, this luxury hotel exudes understated elegance with local cultural elements seamlessly woven into the design, including Javanese shadow puppets, intricate woodcarvings, and traditional geometric patterns.&nbsp;</p> <p>The property stands as a testament to timeless beauty, combining world-class luxury with authentic Indonesian hospitality.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The spa is a sanctuary for renewal, featuring private treatment rooms surrounded by tranquil water features and koi ponds.</li> <li>Wellness facilities include a sauna, an aromatherapy steam room with changing scents, a beauty salon, and a fully equipped fitness center with a dedicated yoga room.</li> <li>Well-manicured pathways wind around decorative fountains throughout the property, which includes an onsite gallery selling curated local crafts.</li> <li>The hotel boasts distinct dining options offering gorgeous views alongside an array of cuisine ranging from authentic regional fare to international options.</li> <li>Dedicated 24-hour butler service is available to assist guests throughout their stay with personalized care and attention.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The fitness center is officially open during standard day hours, but overnight guests can request 24-hour access via their personal butler.</li> <li>No matter which accommodation you choose, you will enjoy the dedicated assistance of a 24-hour personal butler.</li> <li>The hotel provides easy access to key historical sights, cultural landmarks, and transportation hubs across Yogyakarta.</li> <li>House car services and concierge assistance are available to arrange private tours around the historic city and surrounding temples.</li> <li>The property features expansive outdoor spaces, garden paths, and peaceful gazebos designed for relaxation.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The hotel's suites and private villas are sprawled across lush acres of land, connected by inviting garden pathways and hidden gazebos.</li> <li>Exquisite interior design features tropical hardwood floors, vibrant regional art, crystal chandeliers, and ample living space.</li> <li>Private villas feature elevated cabanas perched at the edge of private plunge pools for ultimate seclusion and relaxation.</li> <li>Select accommodations offer direct access to expansive lagoon pools or private garden terraces overlooking serene natural views.</li> <li>Marble-appointed bathrooms come equipped with deep-soaking tubs, rainfall showers, and luxurious bath amenities.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The hotel features fine dining where premium Asian-inspired cuisine is prepared using refined techniques in a sleek open kitchen.</li> <li>Guests can consult with expert sommeliers to pair fine international wines with seasonal tasting menus.</li> <li>Dulang restaurant celebrates the best of Indonesian and Javanese heritage cuisine served in traditional royal style.</li> <li>The main bar offers an elaborate daily afternoon tea service alongside signature evening cocktails inspired by local spices and ingredients.</li> <li>In-room dining is available 24/7, serving a full menu of gourmet international and traditional dishes directly to your room or villa terrace.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Babysitting services, Bar, Gym, House car service, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Restaurants, Spa, Iridium Spa, Lagoon pool, Finnish sauna, Aromatherapy steam room, Beauty salon, Yoga room, 24-hour butler service, Onsite shopping center, Private plunge pools and cabanas",199,299,"2,299",,99,"1,499",29,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UHnOhZG2cHMeRCyY6qHam3jRsDgNCkLG/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1f046KMlvVVUxK3ns2puhrOipuaGDs6MZ/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wpurAGRo27j3Zy63q6FGC8AA1IVI0dNr/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AndEY9E0Ffdiaf0Ci-lmmdXNoDrHTT22/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WbdIT_6vNlhKyZSs63YrKbsqo5CQ68pQ/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PjZFIAKRcXfVg_bTrx7t_8o7vmDRCr4Q/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/12e5la0e9rxfsoxL2hZ7hHdCqki6GJe3m/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1K1pDsFf0Xsjxf92L6bkXwmqHTVFze-gS/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1c5FxBzBRTjzrStmIww8M_xLiJzz2QYai/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KedhI7_nwQYx4tOEo3ukO_mkX2ksLzc1/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YrB92nuzGgT6bh00k29oICOxKY7tVtDR/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Y1xIA4YhM8lBAVfdqdnU713WeqHXFEIs/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UHnOhZG2cHMeRCyY6qHam3jRsDgNCkLG/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1fAL60ydY0BqQVsWtlHxThAaxq5Tx_l-G/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1s1REYjo8VuNe8PapMidCJ_G7lAaRf32a/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1q81r7lmx4oD1oUzur2ErwBFCfxkCUEu3/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1D5pb6bMIWRBuDEJWf1mn-t6RgWgGUMwp/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GNIAEUCyVKduoYlIOrJPy3zji_blJ-aD/view?u