Hanford Eco Resort Busan,"Busan's sleek, tranquil haven","51, Marine City 1-ro, Haeundae-gu, Busan, 48120, South Korea",South Korea,Asia-Pacific,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Eco Resort Busan</h1> <h4><em><strong>Sleek waterfront luxury in Haeundae</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Hanford Eco Resort Busan rises dramatically above the Haeundae coastline, offering residential comfort and breathtaking views of the Gwangan Bridge and Suyeong Bay marina.</p> <p>Designed with clean lines, warm beige-toned wood, and expansive floor-to-ceiling windows, the luxury resort seamlessly connects modern coastal elegance with South Korea’s vibrant natural surroundings.&nbsp;</p> <p>From open charcoal grill dining on the top floors to tranquil oceanfront spa retreats, experience a refined eco-conscious sanctuary by the sea.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Framed by floor-to-ceiling windows, guest accommodations provide panoramic views of the ocean, Suyeong Bay marina, and the illuminated Gwangan Bridge.</li> <li>The top-floor dining collection features an open charcoal grill serving fine steaks, fresh local seafood, and reinterpreted Korean cuisine.</li> <li>Indulge in holistic wellness at the resort spa, featuring natural treatments, steam rooms, saunas, and relaxation lounges overlooking the coast.</li> <li>Stay active at the 24-hour fitness center equipped with premium Technogym equipment and a dedicated studio for personalized physical training.</li> <li>Enjoy the serene indoor swimming pool surrounded by floor-to-ceiling glass, offering sweeping views of Haeundae’s waterfront.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Located in the prestigious Marine City district of Haeundae, the resort offers easy access to local beaches, cultural sites, and luxury shopping destinations.</li> <li>As part of the property's commitment to sustainability, eco-friendly practices and bath amenities are integrated across all guest facilities.</li> <li>The 30th-floor Lounge serves daily afternoon tea, fine coffee, and light refreshments with front-row vistas of the ocean.</li> <li>Dedicated 24-hour concierge services are available to assist guests with private city transportation, tours, and local dining reservations.</li> <li>The resort features extensive event spaces, creative meeting rooms, and specialized wedding managers for memorable seaside celebrations.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Guest rooms and suites feature warm beige-toned wood paneling, contemporary furnishings, and floor-to-ceiling windows with expansive sea views.</li> <li>Luxurious bathrooms are appointed with deep soaking tubs, separate rain shower booths, built-in mirror TVs, and double vanities.</li> <li>In-room technology includes high-speed digital connectivity, media hubs with Bluetooth speakers, and intuitive climate controls.</li> <li>Spacious suites feature separate living and dining areas, providing a cozy residential feel suited for short or extended stays.</li> <li>Amenities include Nespresso coffee makers, stocked minibars, plush bathrobes, and comfortable dining tables for two.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The 32nd-floor main restaurant offers steak and seafood specialties prepared over an open charcoal grill alongside modern Korean dishes.</li> <li>The Living Room serves home-style Italian comfort dishes, signature drinks, and fresh seasonal favorites in a warm, relaxed space.</li> <li>The Living Room Bar provides a chic evening destination with handcrafted cocktails, fine wines, and rare whiskies set against night bridge views.</li> <li>Patisserie at the entry level offers European pastries, artisanal chocolates, and fine coffees, with specialized gift packaging available.</li> <li>In-room dining is available 24 hours a day, offering a selection of local Korean specialties and international culinary favorites.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Babysitting services, Bar, Gym, Indoor pool, Meeting rooms, Pet friendly, Restaurants, Spa, Lumi Spa, Hydrotherapy plunge pools, Sauna, Oceanfront fitness center, Executive lounge",249,349,"1,999","1,999",129,"1,799",59,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SCawpdTPvOzL7ygCXkWJh-IKSbIS1--i/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Z86if1Dcve_ZrjJ0sm_AHzkv5muUM3yO/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TgyEeRQraCkcyzrajYq6zvUQvMr2cCQ4/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uwFfYi36mpelmIrwPp5vrNZvpj_Jic8K/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1m31TgFzVitNxEZhHe0vU4PBfPIQhILVi/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gOioaDgBcvjauDAsbxrq-3VFetcvoIpx/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tTEq28seFt3Px3iGWiQMNHrpCeL-f8e2/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1q47B1Au1sRnVQGev1hLm4JRqpZwcMlTm/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ip1CohN7V-ySORW9Ad5XPDQNreob77Ox/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aT-K68sMLoPSgEHn7K3tEVFplsjKienx/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MCltNSN_dPVLtmoZJ9Lp6r2eUCaREqUg/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1lMohvyPlC9xs2VB5nR74NaBsH7UhlZ7V/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1laTwzt1GkejEv8sGdASeFgPxgJlDyQxR/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nThI_GWDo8Ka6iuTwnoaXJDQWuOneNqT/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eTC9OBD8sZPRxOR_n5328S7ARqpvVLzM/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1UH8-PChvgskP8b4S4KEWs6fsQxQ0FUqO/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iCxbteBZX2SFGVfdKmOXy4HhBx75zX9J/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ARV_2oNZ5Z_WQMjuldmoM23LFCF8cHUk/view?usp=drive_link, https:/