Hanford Grand Hotel Sydney,Grand Luxury on Sydney Harbour,"1 Macquarie Street, Sydney NSW 2000",Australia,Asia-Pacific,Live,"<div><h1>Hanford Grand Hotel Sydney</h1> <h4><em><strong>A luxury hotel in Sydney&rsquo;s Rocks district</strong></em></h4> </div> <div data-maxchar=""250""> <p>Serene, refined, and opulent, Hanford Grand Hotel Sydney is a hidden gem located in The Rocks, Sydney’s most historic neighborhood. Capturing classic elegance, this hotel’s luxe details and intimate setting make for a stylish hideaway.</p> <p>The property blends rich mahogany and deep traditional colors with polished modern touches of gold, white, and pink.&nbsp;</p> <p>Enjoy sunrise over breakfast at the bistro and sunset during afternoon tea or pre-dinner drinks at the sophisticated lounge space.<a>.&nbsp;</a></p> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard01""><strong>Highlights</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Indulge in a signature Afternoon Tea with Wedgwood, featuring premium teas, fine champagne, fresh scones, traditional Australian treats, finger sandwiches, and caviar.</li> <li>The onsite Day Spa provides holistic wellness therapies inspired by traditional Chinese medicine, using sumptuous premium products.</li> <li>Work out at the fully equipped fitness center or play a match on the only hotel tennis court located in Sydney proper.</li> <li>Select rooms feature wrap-around terrace balconies with sweeping views of the historic Rocks district and the western harbor.</li> <li>The property features notable artwork throughout the hotel from famed Australian artists like Brett Whiteley, Sidney Nolan, and Albert Tucker.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard02""><strong>Things to Know</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>The indoor pool features a stunning LED starry Southern Hemisphere sky stretching across the ceiling that twinkles while you swim.</li> <li>Four-legged family members are welcomed with a special Pampered Pets program, complete with a dedicated pet room service menu and plush beds.</li> <li>The hotel is ideally situated within a short walk from top cultural landmarks, including the Museum of Contemporary Art Australia.</li> <li>Guests can utilize house car service and dedicated concierge assistance for private city travel and local bookings.</li> <li>The property combines boutique intimacy with spacious accommodations and high-end luxury facilities.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard03""><strong>The Rooms</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Guest rooms offer some of the largest basic-level accommodations in Sydney, starting around 530 square feet and expanding up to the signature Observatory Suite.</li> <li>Parisian shutters open east toward the iconic Sydney skyline or west toward the Anzac Bridge for unique harbor vistas.</li> <li>In lieu of standard work desks, rooms feature elegant dining tables paired with media hook-ups to create a welcoming, home-like atmosphere.</li> <li>All accommodations feature luxury Blissful beds, marble-clad bathrooms, and premium spa toiletries.</li> <li>Spacious suite options provide expanded living spaces, private dressing areas, and panoramic balcony views.</li> </ul> </div> </div> <div> <h3 data-target=""#ard04""><strong>The Restaurants</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li>Kitchens on Kent redefines dining with an interactive culinary journey featuring multiple live cooking stations showcasing flavors from around the globe.</li> <li>The hotel's lounge bar delivers gastronomic cocktails along with an extensive international list of rare spirits, wines, and fine champagnes.</li> <li>Experience an exclusive midday session with Afternoon Tea with Wedgwood, paired with unlimited sweets and select pourings of Laurent-Perrier champagne.</li> <li>Bistro Remy at the front of the hotel serves daily fresh breakfasts and contemporary regional dishes.</li> <li>In-room dining is available 24/7, offering a complete menu of gourmet dishes delivered directly to your room or suite.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> </div> </div> </div>","Babysitting services, Bar, Gym, House car service, Meeting rooms, Outdoor pool, Pet friendly, Restaurants, Spa, Tennis, Day Spa by Chuan, Indoor starry pool, Interactive buffet (Kitchens on Kent), Afternoon Tea with Wedgwood, Onsite tennis court & Club House",349,699,"3,499",,199,"3,999",99,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1if9CDWZ30QOICU8oXGoZPP0-uulCaick/view?usp=drive_link,"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15yM6aJSvC7_jKud3Cd577evCQ9inKU5x/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DwJyx8wWQoy2sDnM1p5U14yBsa0KsaRP/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/11ug7d1ddLiBQlv05YhEZFrtYXW0vhdVU/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HT5jII8oBo67nXWEG58_pIe_lg9Gb9uU/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1l4huVAgxPCaCfOhXwbY0GBHuQBmJbqqr/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1H1_YPf5aGxPgtAGk1JCOjAWvS4HA8Jez/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1if9CDWZ30QOICU8oXGoZPP0-uulCaick/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DniIFr5NsMuDnIWTBbtU866ghgFr9NHk/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1p94ATjqs8zezAJs2FfO8BJRtD3NNWcrp/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RSjbgZz9KCcaWBI5tYpl3DSLqc4y0TAF/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CtX5ncZwgt9UwNSGUQ2ebH6VuNk6KTjL/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-3Mi_oKw7Y9yAvkgAuHr3FWTJ6vu-v3b/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_6kqC9DU249b_kq9CYb__7yu7OVK0kFR/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1S_NDlvqEWcFgQOIxi1otAqOD2Z0adXB4/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XrZ631cFsdV5qiOjpVyqkgLr0qbZumc2/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/19hEwsaGmIfAsol6lQIv4GH6beiAbHoOB/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1L4hMU0C_fCeMXH0zpoQ1TKDW91UsoZfE/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vrru2P1lY2svGpwP8PhZqt1_yi3kIaZR/view?usp=drive_link, https://drive.google.co